{%- else %}
- `side`: the user prefers to do both sides of a unilateral movement within one session. Use `both` for unilateral movements (catalog `sidedness: "unilateral"`), size reps and duration to cover both sides, and never split one movement into left and right sessions. Use `bilateral` for bilateral movements.
